# Used by BuildKit when building with -f PaddleOCRFastAPI/Dockerfile from the
# repository root. Everything is excluded except what the image needs.
*
!PaddleOCRFastAPI/
!ocr/*.py

# Within those, still leave out:
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
PaddleOCRFastAPI/*.pdf
PaddleOCRFastAPI/Products_*
PaddleOCRFastAPI/screenshots
PaddleOCRFastAPI/docs
PaddleOCRFastAPI/.github
PaddleOCRFastAPI/test_*.py
PaddleOCRFastAPI/*.md

# Environment variables (never bake secrets into an image)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
